Engine Arena
============

Engine Arena is a fork of DroidFish 1.90 by Peter Osterlund
(https://github.com/peterosterlund2/droidfish), licensed under GPLv3.
DroidFish bundles CuckooChess by Peter Osterlund and an old Stockfish
build by the Stockfish developers (GPLv3).

Engine Arena itself is licensed GPLv3. See COPYING.

Bundled chess engines are the work of their respective authors and are
distributed under their own licenses (GPLv3 or MIT). Each engine's
source pin, license, and CCRL rating is recorded in engines/manifest.json.
